ely, with debates in mid-October covering taxes, affordability, immigration and foreign policy.\n\nThe limited polling available shows Powell ahead by 4 to 12 points, and prediction markets put her chances near 95 percent. Most expert raters call the race Likely or Safe Democratic, with a couple more cautious at Tilt or Lean. The seat remains winnable for Republicans if the local race breaks their way, but the weight of evidence favors Powell by a solid margin.", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-22", "p_dem": 0.9278, "margin": 8.8}, {"date": "2026-09-23", "p_dem": 0.9035, "margin": 8.0}, {"date": "2026-09-24", "p_dem": 0.914, "margin": 8.5}, {"date": "2026-09-25", "p_dem": 0.9146, "margin": 8.5}, {"date": "2026-09-26", "p_dem": 0.8905, "margin": 8.5}, {"date": "2026-09-27", "p_dem": 0.9055, "margin": 8.5}, {"date": "2026-09-28", "p_dem": 0.902, "margin": 8.0}, {"date": "2026-09-29", "p_dem": 0.8848, "margin": 7.0}, {"date": "2026-09-30", "p_dem": 0.9024, "margin": 8.0}, {"date": "2026-10-01", "p_dem": 0.9327, "margin": 8.5}, {"date": "2026-10-02", "p_dem": 0.9296, "margin": 8.5}, {"date": "2026-10-03", "p_dem": 0.9341, "margin": 9.0}, {"date": "2026-10-04", "p_dem": 0.918, "margin": 8.5}, {"date": "2026-10-05", "p_dem": 0.882, "margin": 8.0}, {"date": "2026-10-06", "p_dem": 0.9087, "margin": 9.0}, {"date": "2026-10-07", "p_dem": 0.9075, "margin": 9.0}, {"date": "2026-10-08", "p_dem": 0.9316, "margin": 9.0}, {"date": "2026-10-09", "p_dem": 0.9218, "margin": 9.0}, {"date": "2026-10-10", "p_dem": 0.9092, "margin": 9.0}, {"date": "2026-10-11", "p_dem": 0.9089, "margin": 9.0}, {"date": "2026-10-12", "p_dem": 0.9305, "margin": 9.0}, {"date": "2026-10-13", "p_dem": 0.9553, "margin": 10.5}, {"date": "2026-10-14", "p_dem": 0.9401, "margin": 10.0}, {"date": "2026-10-15", "p_dem": 0.9244, "margin": 10.0}]}